<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian five-week T-note yields 5.355 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian five-week T-note yields 5.355 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 mln   5.355	 5.33-5.37   5.380 (May 28)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 mln, pct allotted at top 32)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 mln   5.256	 5.23-5.27   5.330 (May 28)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 mln, pct allotted at top 63)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 mln   5.216	 5.17-5.24   5.805 (May 21)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 mln, pct allotted at top 49)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
